 /Games-to-Go-Chess-and-Checkers-Tote-Bag-Decorating_MadalinaRaduta5-scaled
 -aspect-ratio-1600-1000-scaled.jpeg?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Curious about the origins of chess? This 1-hour workshop will 
 have you leaving with your own travel game tote bag as you explore the int
 ersection between art and function\, and the cross-cultural connections th
 at come with play.\n\nAs we will be working with fabric paints\, please co
 me prepared with a spare shirt or painting smock.
LOCATION:Education Centre\, Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\,
  ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/2026-mlw-chess-tote-bag/
